# Optional AI provider configuration for the Color Duel studio backend.
# Leave OPENAI_API_KEY unset to run with AI controls disabled (the compiler,
# editor, validation and export never need a key).

# Two deployment modes (see README "AI setup (two deployment modes)"):
#
# 1. Bundled bridge (repository Docker setup): compose injects these
#    automatically — do not edit this file for that mode.
#      OPENAI_API_KEY=local-z-ai-bridge        # placeholder for the client contract
#      AI_BASE_URL=http://aibridge:8787/v1/
#      CHAT_MODEL=glm-4.6
#      IMAGE_MODEL=cogview-4
#
# 2. External OpenAI-compatible provider (standalone backend): uncomment and
#    fill in. https://api.openai.com/v1/ is the default AI_BASE_URL; external
#    providers may incur charges.
# OPENAI_API_KEY=your-key
# AI_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1/
# CHAT_MODEL=your-chat-model
# IMAGE_MODEL=your-image-model
